	"data": "Concept: Internet-Scale Gamified World\n\nWhat It Is\nThe ultimate long-term vision: a decentralized, internet-scale game/world where assets are scattered across servers and users' systems — too large to download, streamed on demand. Users own subsets of the world. The \"culmination\" that all smaller projects feed into.\n\nKey Features\nAssets distributed across the decentralized web — no single server\nUsers host portions of the world (their Solid Pod contributes)\nStreamed, not downloaded — only what…",
